{#-
  Lagoon — approve + NAV settlement and operations on a single Lagoon vault.

  ONE vault per config. Pass the RESOLVED vault contract address and the
  RESOLVED underlying asset token address — each a literal `0x…` string or
  a template expression (`{{ aliases.lagoon.<key> }}` for the vault,
  `{{ aliases.tokens.<SYM> }}` for the asset). The template does no further
  alias lookup; vaults are case-specific so the registry ships no globals.

  Required template params:
    vault — the 0x-prefixed Lagoon vault contract address.
    asset — the 0x-prefixed underlying asset token (the vault's `asset()`):
            the ERC-20 the vault pulls from the Safe on deposit. The role is
            granted approve(spender = vault, amount = *) on this token ONLY.

  Output shape:
    - One approve role on `asset`: erc20.approve(spender, amount) with the
      spender pinned to `vault` (equal_to) and amount left `pass`. This lets
      the Safe authorize the vault to pull its underlying on deposit, and
      authorize nothing else — the spender is hard-scoped to the vault, and
      approve on any other token is not granted.
    - One vault role on `vault`, with six allowed functions, all
      execution_options: "none". Every parameter is declared `pass`
      explicitly (zac's validator requires every signature param to be
      covered); the all-pass optimization in `toSdkTargets` then
      collapses this to `allowFunction` on-chain.
    - Six functions covered (see Lagoon docs §Smart-Contract Reference):
      • settleDeposit(uint256)            — confirm NAV + settle pending deposits
      • settleRedeem(uint256)             — confirm NAV + settle pending redemptions
      • expireTotalAssets()               — force the current NAV value to expire
      • updateTotalAssetsLifespan(uint128)— adjust how long a posted NAV stays valid
      • claimSharesOnBehalf(address[])    — push minted shares to depositors post-settlement
      • claimAssetsOnBehalf(address[])    — push redeemed assets to redeemers post-settlement
-#}
{%- from "_macros/common.tmpl" import approve -%}
roles:
  {{ approve(asset, vault) | indent(2) }}

  - address: "{{ vault }}"
    functions:
      - signature: "function settleDeposit(uint256 _newTotalAssets)"
        execution_options: "none"
        params:
          - name: _newTotalAssets
            param_type: "static"
            operator: "pass"

      - signature: "function settleRedeem(uint256 _newTotalAssets)"
        execution_options: "none"
        params:
          - name: _newTotalAssets
            param_type: "static"
            operator: "pass"

      - signature: "function expireTotalAssets()"
        execution_options: "none"

      - signature: "function updateTotalAssetsLifespan(uint128 lifespan)"
        execution_options: "none"
        params:
          - name: lifespan
            param_type: "static"
            operator: "pass"

      - signature: "function claimSharesOnBehalf(address[] controllers)"
        execution_options: "none"
        params:
          - name: controllers
            param_type: "dynamic"
            operator: "pass"

      - signature: "function claimAssetsOnBehalf(address[] controllers)"
        execution_options: "none"
        params:
          - name: controllers
            param_type: "dynamic"
            operator: "pass"
